            "review_title": "Review at Ngu Uyen Phu Quoc Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Rayman2012\nLos Angeles, California84 contributions\n0\nLoved the mystery meat on a stick!\nJan 2018 • Couples\nMy wife and I had a great bite to eat here. We selected the mystery meat on a stick and requested ones hot off the grill. \n\nThis dish is served with raw vegetables, but we substituted for noodles as we are bit uncomfortable eating uncooked food here. \n\nThe whole thing only cost us 40,000 Dong!!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 4, 2018",
